  "description": "Deterministic, framework-agnostic pathfinding and navigation for lockstep simulations and games. Trailblazer combines FixedMathSharp fixed-point math, GridForge voxel navigation charts, A* paths, flow fields, reusable guide caching, transition-aware routing, steering, turning, locomotion, heightmaps, and Chronicler serialization support.",
